    "Description": "crun is a OCI runtime\n\nSecurity Fix(es):\n\n* crun: crun: rootful krun with passt executes container payload as host root (CVE-2026-84042)\n\nBug Fix(es) and Enhancement(s):\n\n* crun should require container-selinux (JIRA:RHEL-169227)\n\n* update to the latest upstream release (JIRA:RHEL-185741)\n\nFor more details about the security issue(s), including the impact, a CVSS score, acknowledgments, and other related information, refer to the CVE page(s) listed in the References section.\n\nAdditional Changes:\n\nFor detailed information on changes in this release, see the Red Hat Enterprise Linux 9 Release Notes linked from the References section.",
